3066 &"{rvrs on} {cyan}         Lt. Kernal Programs{pound}{back arrow}37{rvrs off} {rvrs on}{blue} {f6}{rvrs on}  {rvrs off}{pound}{back arrow}38{rvrs on} {f6}"
